                },
                "category": "offensive",
                "description": {
                    "value": "<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per day</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> The puntzelken attempts to curse a creature within 60 feet. The target attempts a @Check[will|dc:22] save.</p><hr /><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The creature gains the puntzelken's weakness to bludgeoning damage and falling vulnerability for 1 round.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> As success, but the effect lasts for 24 hours.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> As success, but the effect lasts for 1 week.</p>"
