            "privateNotes": "",
            "publicNotes": "<p>A puntzelken is a short, stocky creature, roughly the size of an adult dwarf, and resembles nothing so much as an anthropomorphic egg. Puntzelkens are usually encountered near mortal settlements, where they seek out vantage points that offer opportunities to converse with passersby: bridges, fence posts, or walls alongside well-traveled roads. Despite their enthusiasm for social interaction, most puntzelkens come across as condescending and arrogant, seemingly engaging in conversation for the sole purpose of lording their knowledge over others.</p>\n<p>Slow and uncoordinated, puntzelkens generally avoid combat, using their innate magic to flee if a confrontation turns violent. A provoked puntzelken, however, can prove a capable combatant, viciously pummeling enemies with the silver spoon-like implement they carry as a walking stick.</p>",
